{"id":"9d13d70315b40a86","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-valuation.md","title":"ZFC Forcing3 Boolean Valuation","display":"df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-valuation — ZFC Forcing3 Boolean Valuation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-valuation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-valuation"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-valuation — ZFC Forcing3 Boolean Valuation","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-valuation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-valuation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing3-boolean-valuation — ZFC Forcing3 Boolean Valuation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b317b32e88081cdf\" href=\"?note=b317b32e88081cdf\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},U,\\dot x,x\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},U,\\dot x,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (transitive-model predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (complete Boolean algebra predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (poset-generic filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (recursive name-evaluation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3BooleanValuation}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3BooleanValuation}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valuation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3BooleanValuation}_S(M,\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},U,\\dot x,x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathbb B\\in M\\land\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_S(U,\\mathbb B,M,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\land\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\dot x,U,\\mathbb B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valuation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3BooleanValuation}_S(M,\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},U,\\dot x,x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathbb B\\in M\\land\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_S(U,\\mathbb B,M,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\land\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\dot x,U,\\mathbb B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Boolean-valued name is evaluated by a generic filter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb B\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\)</span>. Using a set-ultrafilter predicate whose elements are subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span> would give the wrong type for name evaluation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"b317b32e88081cdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d